      "category": "video",
      "title": "Jon Batiste on the podcast",
      "creator": null,
      "note": "This podcast episode is one of my all-time favorites. It’s rare that I rewatch or re-listen to my own stuff, but this is an exception. The flow was magical, and the live music was mesmerizing. Jon brought bottled lightning, and I was lucky to be there. Trust me on this one. For those who don’t know Jon, he is a five-time Grammy Award-winning and Academy Award-winning singer, songwriter, and composer.",
